---
layout: base.njk
title: Professional Dental Care in Ahmedabad
description: Comprehensive dental services including cleanings, root canals, implants, and orthodontics. Book your appointment today.
---

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Welcome to</div>
    <h1>Smile Dental Clinic</h1>
    <p>From routine cleanings to advanced restorations, we provide comprehensive dental care in a calm, welcoming environment.</p>
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book appointment <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn btn-ghost">View services <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- About -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about-image">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606811841689-23dfddce3e95?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Professional dental practice environment">
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="section-header" style="text-align: left; margin: 0 0 2rem 0; max-width: 100%;">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Who We Are</div>
        <h2>Your oral health is our priority</h2>
      </div>
      <p>At Smile Dental Clinic, we believe that quality dental care should be accessible, comfortable, and personalized. Our team of licensed professionals brings years of experience and a commitment to staying current with the latest techniques and technologies.</p>
      <p>We create a welcoming environment where you feel heard and cared for. Whether you're visiting for a routine cleaning or a complex procedure, we take the time to explain your options and address any concerns.</p>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li>Licensed, experienced dental professionals</li>
        <li>Modern equipment and techniques</li>
        <li>Patient-centered care approach</li>
        <li>Flexible scheduling and emergency services</li>
        <li>Transparent pricing and insurance coordination</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Services -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Our Services</div>
    <h2>Comprehensive dental care under one roof</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">From preventive cleanings to advanced restorations, we offer a full range of dental treatments tailored to your needs.</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="services-grid">
    {% for service in services %}
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-card-top">{{ service.icon }}</div>
      <div class="service-card-content">
        <h3>{{ service.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ service.description }}</p>
        <a href="#contact">Schedule a visit →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Testimonials -->
<section id="testimonials">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">What Patients Say</div>
    <h2>Trusted by our community</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Real feedback from patients who've experienced our care.</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="testimonials-grid">
    <div class="testimonial">
      <p class="testimonial-text">"The entire team made me feel comfortable. They explained every step and truly listen to your concerns."</p>
      <div class="testimonial-author">
        <div class="author-initial">A</div>
        <div class="author-info">
          <h4>Anjali M.</h4>
          <p>Regular patient</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="testimonial">
      <p class="testimonial-text">"Professional, punctual, and painless. The best dental experience I've had. Highly recommend!"</p>
      <div class="testimonial-author">
        <div class="author-initial">R</div>
        <div class="author-info">
          <h4>Rajesh P.</h4>
          <p>Regular patient</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="testimonial">
      <p class="testimonial-text">"They have modern equipment and a very calm approach. I was nervous, but they made me feel at ease."</p>
      <div class="testimonial-author">
        <div class="author-initial">P</div>
        <div class="author-info">
          <h4>Priya S.</h4>
          <p>Regular patient</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Contact -->
<section id="contact">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Get in Touch</div>
    <h2>Schedule your appointment</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Reach out to us to book a visit or ask any questions about our services.</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="contact-container">
    <div>
      <form>
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New appointment request from website">
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Full Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="phone">Phone</label>
          <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
        </div>
        
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send Message</button>
        <div class="form-message"></div>
      </form>
    </div>
    
    <div class="contact-info">
      <div>
        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>Hours</h3>
          <div class="info-item">
            <strong>Monday – Friday</strong><br>
            9:00 AM – 6:00 PM
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <strong>Saturday</strong><br>
            10:00 AM – 4:00 PM
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <strong>Sunday</strong><br>
            Closed
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>Contact Info</h3>
          <div class="info-item">
            <strong>Phone</strong><br>
            <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">{{ site.phone_display }}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <strong>Email</strong><br>
            <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <strong>Address</strong><br>
            {{ site.address }}<br>
            {{ site.address_short }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="map-container">
        <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3671.512345678!2d72.52!3d23.19!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x395c2b5a00000!2sEllisbridge!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <h2>Ready to start your journey to better oral health?</h2>
  <p>Get in touch with our team today to schedule your appointment or learn more about our services.</p>
  <div class="cta-group" style="justify-content: center;">
    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="background: white; color: var(--primary); border-color: white;">Book Now <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>
    <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}" class="btn btn-ghost">Call Us <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
